Here is how I did it in my implementation ... just calculate the padding and then add the octets, let the user figure it out.

      padding = (8 - count % 8) % 8;
      num_bytes = (count + padding) / 8;
      proto_tree_add_item(tbtree, hf_ieee80211_tag_ranging_tb_ista_availability_window, tvb, offset, num_bytes, ENC_NA);
      offset += num_bytes;
      break;

